子：廙、岑、嶠、鑒、[[晉書/卷061#華軼|澹]]、簡。","raw_start":6036,"raw_end":6356,"raw_line":77},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huabiao","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huabiao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001","text":"華軼，字彥夏，平原人，魏太尉歆之曾孫也。祖表，太中大夫。父澹，河南尹。軼少有才氣，聞於當世，泛愛博納，眾論美之。初為博士，累遷散騎常侍。東海王越牧兗州，引為留府長史。永嘉中，曆振威將軍、江州刺史。雖逢喪亂，每崇典禮，置儒林祭酒以弘道訓，乃下教曰：「今大義頹替，禮典無宗，朝廷滯議，莫能攸正，常以慨然，宜特立此官，以弘其事。軍諮祭酒杜夷，棲情玄遠，確然絕俗，才學精博，道行優備，其以為儒林祭酒。」俄被越檄使助討諸賊，軼遣前江夏太守陶侃為揚武將軍，率兵三千屯夏口，以為聲援。軼在州其有威惠，州之豪士接以友道，得江表之歡心，流亡之士赴之如歸。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":97,"last_line":97,"raw_start":7681,"raw_end":7966,"raw_character_offsets":[7683,7684,7685,7686,7687,7688,7689,7690,7691,7692,7693,7694,7695,7696,7697,7698,7699,7700,7701,7702,7716,7717,7720,7721,7722,7723,7724,7725,7726,7727,7728,7729,7730,7731,7732,7733,7734,7735,7736,7737,7738,7739,7740,7741,7742,7743,7744,7745,7746,7747,7748,7749,7750,7751,7752,7753,7754,7755,7756,7757,7758,7759,7760,7761,7762,7763,7764,7765,7766,7767,7768,7769,7770,7771,7772,7773,7774,7775,7776,7777,7778,7779,7780,7781,7782,7783,7784,7785,7786,7787,7788,7789,7790,7791,7792,7793,7794,7795,7796,7797,7798,7799,7800,7801,7802,7803,7804,7805,7806,7807,7808,7809,7810,7811,7812,7813,7814,7815,7816,7817,7818,7819,7820,7821,7822,7823,7824,7825,7826,7827,7828,7829,7830,7831,7832,7833,7834,7835,7836,7837,7838,7839,7840,7841,7842,7843,7844,7845,7846,7847,7848,7849,7850,7851,7852,7853,7854,7855,7856,7857,7858,7859,7860,7861,7862,7863,7864,7865,7866,7867,7868,7869,7870,7871,7872,7873,7874,7875,7876,7877,7878,7879,7880,7881,7882,7883,7884,7885,7886,7887,7888,7889,7890,7891,7892,7893,7894,7895,7896,7897,7898,7899,7900,7901,7902,7903,7904,7905,7906,7907,7908,7909,7910,7911,7912,7913,7914,7915,7916,7917,7918,7919,7920,7921,7922,7923,7924,7925,7926,7927,7928,7929,7930,7931,7932,7933,7934,7935,7936,7937,7938,7939,7940,7941,7942,7943,7944,7945,7946,7947,7948,7949,7950,7951,7952,7953,7954,7955,7956,7957,7958,7959,7960,7961,7962,7963,7964,7965],"revision_id":7903772},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0000","surface":"華軼","start":0,"end":2,"person_id":"p86_bh6_jm2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0014","surface":"歆","start":14,"end":15,"person_id":"7zi_5gs_mq2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0020","surface":"祖表","start":20,"end":22,"person_id":"7zi_5gs_mq2_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0029","surface":"澹","start":29,"end":30,"person_id":"7zi_5gs_mq2_AD","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0035","surface":"軼","start":35,"end":36,"person_id":"p86_bh6_jm2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0068","surface":"東海王越","start":68,"end":72,"person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0165","surface":"杜夷","start":165,"end":167,"person_id":"xs5_2s2_rfa","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0199","surface":"越","start":199,"end":200,"person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0207","surface":"軼","start":207,"end":208,"person_id":"p86_bh6_jm2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0214","surface":"陶侃","start":214,"end":216,"person_id":"twd_erg_kmz","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p001:m0235","surface":"軼","start":235,"end":236,"person_id":"p86_bh6_jm2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-huayi-ws7903772"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-jin044-huabiao:father","text":"太中大夫。父澹，河南尹。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-061-jin044-huabiao:father:m0006","start"